1243+ 7A3C              ;===============================================================
1244+ 7A3C              ;http://z80-heaven.wikidot.com/math#toc32
1245+ 7A3C              ;Input:
1246+ 7A3C              ;     DE points to the base 10 number string in RAM.
1247+ 7A3C              ;Outputs:
1248+ 7A3C              ;     HL is the 16-bit value of the number
1249+ 7A3C              ;     DE points to the byte after the number
1250+ 7A3C              ;     BC is HL/10
1251+ 7A3C              ;     z flag reset (nz)
