1253+ 7A3C              ;Destroys:
1254+ 7A3C              ;     A (actually, add 30h and you get the ending token)
1255+ 7A3C              ;Size:  23 bytes
1256+ 7A3C              ;Speed: 104n+42+11c
1257+ 7A3C              ;       n is the number of digits
